From: mpv-ht <mpv-ht@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] video: preserve Dolby Vision EL classification when copying image attributes

Hardware downloads restore mpv-only attributes after the AVFrame transfer.
Retain the FEL/MEL type alongside those attributes so copy decoders report
the same classification as direct decoders. Rendering is unchanged.

---
diff --git a/video/mp_image.c b/video/mp_image.c
index 072f53fe87ad79fe12583a8c707bb9811fdc0204..3b5933e51ac37f302557be49faa5cf6b30bd1b1a 100644
--- a/video/mp_image.c
+++ b/video/mp_image.c
@@ -561,6 +561,7 @@ void mp_image_copy_attributes(struct mp_image *dst, struct mp_image *src)
     dst->params.primaries_orig = src->params.primaries_orig;
     dst->params.transfer_orig = src->params.transfer_orig;
     dst->params.sys_orig = src->params.sys_orig;
+    dst->params.dovi_el_type = src->params.dovi_el_type;
     dst->params.authored_scene_cut = src->params.authored_scene_cut;
     dst->params.hdr10plus_signature = src->params.hdr10plus_signature;
     dst->params.source_hdr = src->params.source_hdr;
